return {h=4,w=80,cr=225,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"water1","dragon"},st={30,40,70,70,25,60},ab={{33,0},{97,0},{6,1}},genus={en="Dragon Pokémon",es="Pokémon Dragón",pt="Pokémon Dragão"},flavor={en={[1]="Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.",[2]="Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.",[3]="If it senses any danger, it will vigorously spray water or a special type of ink from its mouth.",[4]="If attacked by a larger enemy, it quickly swims to safety by adeptly controlling its dorsal fin.",[5]="Its big, developed fins move rapidly, allowing it to swim backward while still facing forward.",[6]="When they're in a safe location, they can be seen playfully tangling their tails together.",[7]="HORSEA eats small insects and moss off of rocks. If the ocean current turns fast, this Pokémon anchors itself by wrapping its tail around rocks or coral to prevent being washed away.",[8]="If HORSEA senses danger, it will reflexively spray a dense black ink from its mouth and try to escape. This Pokémon swims by cleverly flapping the fins on its back.",[9]="By cleverly flicking the fins on its back side to side, it moves in any direction while facing forward. It spits ink to escape if it senses danger.",[10]="It maintains balance using its tail, which is wound up like a coil. It may spray ink from its mouth.",[11]="Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.",[12]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[13]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[14]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[15]="If attacked by a larger enemy, it quickly swims to safety by adeptly controlling its well-developed dorsal fin.",[16]="Its big, developed fins move rapidly, allowing it to swim backward while still facing forward.",[17]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[18]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[21]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[22]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[23]="Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.",[24]="It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.",[25]="Horsea eats small insects and moss off of rocks. If the ocean current turns fast, this Pokémon anchors itself by wrapping its tail around rocks or coral to prevent being washed away.",[26]="If Horsea senses danger, it will reflexively spray a dense black ink from its mouth and try to escape. This Pokémon swims by cleverly flapping the fin on its back.",[31]="If it senses any danger, it will vigorously spray water or a special type of ink from its mouth.",[32]="If it senses any danger, it will vigorously spray water or a special type of ink from its mouth.",[33]="Horsea makes its home in oceans with gentle currents. If this Pokémon is under attack, it spits out pitch-black ink and escapes.",[34]="They swim with dance-like motions and cause whirlpools to form. Horsea compete to see which of them can generate the biggest whirlpool."},es={[23]="Es famoso por derribar a bichos voladores lanzando tinta desde la superficie del agua.",[24]="Hace su nido entre los corales. Si se siente en peligro, escupe tinta y huye.",[25]="Horsea come insectos pequeños y el musgo de las rocas. Si las corrientes del océano cobran fuerza, este Pokémon se anclará con la cola a rocas o corales para evitar que las aguas lo arrastren.",[26]="Si Horsea siente peligro, echará por la boca una densa tinta negra inconscientemente e intentará huir. Este Pokémon nada muy bien batiendo la aleta que tiene en el lomo.",[31]="Si se siente en peligro, arrojará un potente chorro de agua o de una tinta especial por la boca.",[32]="Si se siente en peligro, arrojará un potente chorro de agua o de una tinta especial por la boca.",[33]="Habita en mares de aguas tranquilas. Si se siente en peligro, expulsará por la boca una densa tinta negra para poder huir.",[34]="Nada con la gracilidad de un bailarín, creando remolinos a su paso, y juega con sus congéneres a ver quién forma el más grande."},pt="Nadam com movimentos que parecem uma dança e formam redemoinhos. Os Horsea competem para ver qual deles consegue criar o maior redemoinho."},evo={{s=116},{s=117,from=116,c={{t="level-up",lv=32}}},{s=230,from=117,c={{t="trade",held=212}}}},moves={[1]={1,145,19,108,24,43,30,55,37,97,45,56},[2]={1,145,19,108,24,43,30,55,37,97,45,56},[3]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56},[4]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56},[5]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56,50,349},[6]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56,50,349},[7]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56,50,349},[8]={1,145,4,108,8,43,11,55,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[9]={1,145,4,108,8,43,11,55,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[10]={1,145,4,108,8,43,11,55,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[11]={1,145,4,108,8,43,11,55,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[12]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56,50,349},[13]={1,145,8,108,15,43,22,55,29,239,36,97,43,56,50,349},[14]={1,145,4,108,8,43,11,55,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[15]={1,55,4,108,8,43,11,145,14,116,18,61,23,97,26,239,30,362,35,56,38,349,42,406},[16]={1,145,5,108,9,43,13,55,17,239,21,61,26,116,31,362,36,97,41,406,46,349,52,56},[17]={1,145,5,108,9,43,13,55,17,239,21,61,26,116,31,362,36,97,41,406,46,349,52,56},[18]={1,145,5,108,9,43,13,55,17,239,21,61,26,116,31,362,36,97,41,406,46,349,52,56},[19]={1,145,6,10